#. 【確信】
msgctxt "0001 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "[basis]"
msgstr ""

#. 確信があるって…ホントなの…？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Is there really proof...?"
msgstr ""

#. これからお前をある場所に連れていく。
#. そこで<CLT 3>“根拠”<CLT>を見せてやろう。
msgctxt "0003 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"There's somewhere I'd like to take you. This will\n"
"provide all the <CLT 3>evidence<CLT> you need."
msgstr ""

#. 不二咲千尋を殺したのが、
#. ジェノサイダー翔だという根拠をな！
msgctxt "0004 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Evidence that Genocide Jack is the one that killed\n"
"Chihiro!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こ、根拠って…
#. そんなものがホントに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Evidence... Does something like that really...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あっ！　そこの２人！！
msgctxt "0006 | NO NAME"
msgid "Ah! Hey you two!"
msgstr ""

#. た、大変なの、助けて…
msgctxt "0007 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Big trouble! Need your help!"
msgstr ""

#. 俺達は忙しいんだ。ジャマをするな…
msgctxt "0008 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "We're busy. Leave us alone!"
msgstr ""

#. 緊急事態なんだよ…緊急事態…
msgctxt "0009 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "But it's an emergency...! Emergency!"
msgstr ""

#. だから助けて！　お願いッ！！
msgctxt "0010 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "C'mon, please! You gotta help me!"
msgstr ""

#. 【緊急事態】
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "[e-mer-gen-cyyy]"
msgstr ""

#. 緊急事態って…何があったの…？
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "An emergency? What happened?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>腐川<CLT>ちゃんがね、大変なの…
#. なんか様子がおかしくなっちゃったの…
msgctxt "0013 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Something's wrong with <CLT 3>Toko<CLT>. She's acting super\n"
"strange!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや…さっきの時点でも、
#. 十分おかしかったけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, I mean...she was acting pretty strange earlier,\n"
"right?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …どうする、十神クン？
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...What should we do, Byakuya?"
msgstr ""

#. 腐川冬子か…少々気に掛かるな…
msgctxt "0016 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Since it's Toko...I must admit, I'm intrigued."
msgstr ""

#. ちょっと様子を見に行ってやるか…
msgctxt "0017 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I suppose we can take a second to see what's going on\n"
"with her."
msgstr ""

#. …いいの？
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Are you sure?"
msgstr ""

#. 何度も言わせるな。
msgctxt "0019 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Don't make me repeat myself."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんか…意外な反応だな。
#. てっきり、冷たくあしらうと思ってたのに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I...didn't expect that. I thought for sure he'd just\n"
"say no, and that'd be the end of it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ急いで付いて来て！　ほら早く早くッ！！
msgctxt "0021 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Okay, okay, come on! Hurry!"
msgstr ""

#. ちょ、ちょっと待って…朝日奈さんッ！
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "W-Wait for us, Hina!"
msgstr ""

#. 寄宿舎の方に向かったようだ。
#. おそらく<CLT 3>腐川の個室<CLT>だろう…
msgctxt "0023 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It looks like she headed to the dorms. To <CLT 3>Toko's\n"
"room<CLT>, most likely."
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…！
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You're right!"
msgstr ""

#. 【ジェノサイダー翔】
msgctxt "0025 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "[Genocide Jack]"
msgstr ""

#. ジェノサイダー翔って…
#. あの殺人鬼の事だよね？
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That murderous fiend is...Genocide Jack, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 他にいないだろう…
msgctxt "0027 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "There's nobody else it could be."
msgstr ""

#. 猟奇的かつ、残忍な手口で
#. 殺人を繰り返す凶悪犯…
msgctxt "0028 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"A murderous fiend, who kills again and again using a\n"
"bizarre and brutal method..."
msgstr ""

#. 通り魔的、無差別的、突発的な犯行ばかりゆえ、
#. 警察もその足取りを掴めていない状態…
msgctxt "0029 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"They're like a ghost, attacking suddenly then slipping\n"
"away before the police can catch up to them."
msgstr ""

#. そんな連続殺人事件の容疑者に、
#. ネット上で与えられたあだ名が…
msgctxt "0030 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"And what nickname did the Internet give to this\n"
"mysterious serial killer?"
msgstr ""

#. ジェノサイダー翔…
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Genocide Jack..."
msgstr ""

#. 犠牲者は数千人にも及ぶ…っていうのは
#. さすがに都市伝説だろうけど…
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"They say he's killed thousands of people. But that's\n"
"gotta be an urban legend..."
msgstr ""

#. とにかく、ボク達の中に
#. そんな常軌を逸した殺人鬼がいるって事…？
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Still, could one of us really be a demented, psychotic\n"
"killer like that?"
msgstr ""

#. ああ、その通りだ…
msgctxt "0034 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "You're not wrong to wonder."
msgstr ""

#. でも…いくらなんでも…
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But words mean little right now."
msgstr ""

#. そう確信出来る根拠もあるぞ。
#. お前に、それを見せてやろう…
msgctxt "0036 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I have something that will prove it. And I can show\n"
"you."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>玄関ホールに…来たけど……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We came to...the main hall.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …十神クン、ここに何があるの？
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So...what are we looking for here?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0039 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>自分で考えろって事か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Does that mean I have to figure it out for myself?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0041 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>自分で考えろって事か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Does that mean I have to figure it out for myself?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 十神クン、正確には違うって…
#. どういう意味？
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"What do you mean by that, Byakuya? \"To be exact...not\n"
"quite.\""
msgstr ""

#. 確かに、俺が突き止めたいのは犯人だが、
#. より正確に言うならば…
msgctxt "0044 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Certainly I want to reveal Chihiro's killer, but more\n"
"precisely..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>ジェノサイダー翔の正体<CLT>だ。
msgctxt "0045 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"...I want to discover the <CLT 3>true identity of Genocide\n"
"Jack<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、十神クンは本当に…
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Then...you really think...?"
msgstr ""

#. 不二咲さんを殺したのは、
#. ジェノサイダー翔だと思ってるの？
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You truly believe Genocide Jack is the one that killed\n"
"Chihiro?"
msgstr ""

#. …当然だ。今回の事件の犯人は、
#. <CLT 1>【ジェノサイダー翔】<CLT>で間違いない。
msgctxt "0048 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Absolutely. I have no doubt that <CLT 1>[Genocide Jack]<CLT> is\n"
"the culprit in this case."
msgstr ""

#. 俺は<CLT 1>【確信】<CLT>を持っている。
#. ジェノサイダー翔は、俺達の中にいるんだ。
msgctxt "0049 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"And I have a <CLT 1>[basis]<CLT> to believe that. I assure you,\n"
"Genocide Jack is one of us."
msgstr ""

#. うるさい女だな…
msgctxt "0050 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Such an annoying girl..."
msgstr ""

#. 緊急事態なの緊急事態！！
#. だから助けて…お願いお願いッ！！
msgctxt "0051 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"This is a serious emergency! Please, please! You gotta\n"
"help me!"
msgstr ""

#. ちょっと落ち着いて、朝日奈さん…
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Just calm down, okay Hina?"
msgstr ""

#. だって…だってね…
#. <CLT 1>【緊急事態】<CLT>なんだよ…！
msgctxt "0053 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "But...but...! It's an <CLT 1>[e-mer-gen-cyyy]<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今は校章が浮かんでいるだけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ここには手掛かりはなさそうだ。
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I don't see any clues around here anywhere."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…に銃みたいな物が付いている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera... And there's what I can only\n"
"assume is a gun attached to it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もの凄い…威圧感だな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's so...chilling.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>入口は…機械のような鉄の塊で
#. 塞がれてしまっている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The hunk of metal blocking the entrance seems like\n"
"some kind of...machine.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>レターケースが置いてある。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a mailbox here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もしかして、この中に何か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0060 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Could there be something inside...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって、<CLT><CLT 3>電子生徒手帳<CLT><CLT 4>！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's...an <CLT><CLT 3>e-Handbook<CLT><CLT 4>!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、３つもある！
#. でも、どうしてこんな所に！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No, wait...there's *three* of them! But what are they\n"
"doing here?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 見つけたようだな…
msgctxt "0063 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "So, you finally found them."
msgstr ""

#. え？　十神クンは知ってるの？
#. この電子生徒手帳がなんだか…
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? Did you know these were here, Byakuya?"
msgstr ""

#. 俺も、この間たまたま見つけたんだが…
msgctxt "0065 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I happened to find them by chance myself the other\n"
"day."
msgstr ""

#. どうやら、<CLT 3>死んだ人間の電子生徒手帳<CLT>は、
#. そこのレターケースに<CLT 3>“返還”<CLT>される仕組みらしい。
msgctxt "0066 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It seems there's a system in place where the\n"
"<CLT 3>handbooks of dead students<CLT> get \"<CLT 3>delivered<CLT>\" to this mailbox."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、この３つの電子生徒手帳って…
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So then, these three handbooks belong to..."
msgstr ""

#. 江ノ島さんと桑田クンと…
#. 舞園さんの物…？
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Junko, Leon, and Sayaka?"
msgstr ""

#. 自分の目で確かめてみろ…
msgctxt "0069 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "You can go ahead and confirm it yourself."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは、すぐに電子生徒手帳の１つを起動させてみた。
#. すると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I immediately turned on one of the handbooks. And when\n"
"I did...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ホントだ…舞園さんの電子生徒手帳だ…！
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You're right! This is Sayaka's handbook!"
msgstr ""

#. これでわかっただろう？
#. さっき言っていた<CLT 3>“抜け道”<CLT>の意味が…
msgctxt "0072 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Now do you understand? This is the key to the\n"
"<CLT 3>loophole<CLT> that I revealed earlier."
msgstr ""

#. …うん、わかった気がするよ。
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah, I feel like I'm starting to get it..."
msgstr ""

#. もう一度、よく校則を確認してみるんだな。
#. 追加されたルールには、こうあったはずだ。
msgctxt "0074 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"You should pay closer attention to the regulations.\n"
"The answer has been in front of you the entire time."
msgstr ""

#. 『電子生徒手帳の他人への貸与禁止』とな…
msgctxt "0075 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"\"Loaning your e-Handbook to another student is\n"
"strictly prohibited.\""
msgstr ""

#. 禁止されてるのは、他人に貸す行為だけだ。
#. <CLT 3>借りる事は禁止されていない<CLT>。
msgctxt "0076 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Only the act of *loaning* a handbook is prohibited.\n"
"<CLT 3>Borrowing someone else's is perfectly fine<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そうか…そういう事だったんだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I see...yeah, now I understand.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>玄関ホールの電子生徒手帳<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0078 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Main Hall e-Handbooks<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ん…？　これはなんだ…？
msgctxt "0079 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Hm? Hold on a second..."
msgstr ""

#. …どうかしたの？
msgctxt "0080 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

#. 妙だな。ここにある電子生徒手帳の１つだけが…
msgctxt "0081 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "That's strange. One of the handbooks..."
msgstr ""

#. …<CLT 3>起動しなくなっている<CLT>。
msgctxt "0082 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "...<CLT 3>won't turn on<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 壊れてるって事？　それって誰の？
msgctxt "0083 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Is it broken? Whose is it?"
msgstr ""

#. もう１つの電子生徒手帳の起動画面には、
#. 江ノ島盾子と出る…
msgctxt "0084 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"The other handbook showed Junko's name when I started\n"
"it up."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、起動しないのって…桑田クンの？
msgctxt "0085 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Then the one that won't turn on must be...Leon's,\n"
"right?"
msgstr ""

#. …だとしたら無理ないのかもな。
msgctxt "0086 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "It would make sense, yes."
msgstr ""

#. 硬球で…あれだけ滅多打ちにされてはな…
msgctxt "0087 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"After all, he did get pummeled with dozens and dozens\n"
"of baseballs."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>硬球で…滅多打ち…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0088 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Pummeled with baseballs...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つい思い出してしまった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0089 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The memory of it came flooding back.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>桑田クンを死に至らしめた…あの残酷な処刑…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0090 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That cruel punishment, which led to Leon's death...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕のヤツが仕組んだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0091 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The execution that the mastermind concocted...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>惨たらしくて悪趣味な処刑を……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0092 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A cruel, heartless death...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 確かに…あれだけやられたら…
#. 壊れてもおかしくないよ…
msgctxt "0093 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You're right. It wouldn't be surprising for the\n"
"handbook to break during that kind of assault."
msgstr ""

#. コラコラ…！
msgctxt "0094 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Hey, hey!"
msgstr ""

#. コラコラコラコラ…！
msgctxt "0095 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Hey hey hey hey hey!"
msgstr ""

#. コラァッ！！
msgctxt "0096 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "HEEEY!"
msgstr ""

#. な、なんだよ…
msgctxt "0097 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wh-What...?"
msgstr ""

#. その電子生徒手帳はなぁ、
#. この学園生活において必要不可欠なアイテムなんだ。
msgctxt "0098 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"That e-Handbook is essential to student life here!\n"
"Crucial, integral, instrumental, a super big deal!"
msgstr ""

#. だから、そんなに簡単に<CLT 3>壊れたりしない<CLT>のッ！！
msgctxt "0099 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "There's no way it would <CLT 3>break<CLT> that easily!"
msgstr ""

#. でも、実際に…
msgctxt "0100 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But it did..."
msgstr ""

#. 壊れないったら壊れないのッ！！
msgctxt "0101 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"If I say it wouldn't break, it wouldn't freakin'\n"
"break!"
msgstr ""

#. だって、１０トンの衝撃にも耐えられるし、
#. 水深１００メートルでもへっちゃらなんだよ？
msgctxt "0102 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"It can withstand up to ten tons of pressure, and it's\n"
"waterproof up to a hundred meters, okay!?"
msgstr ""

#. 硬球なんて、いくらぶつけたところで、
#. 壊れたりする訳ないじゃーん！！
msgctxt "0103 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I don't care how many baseballs you hit it with, it\n"
"wouldn't do crap!"
msgstr ""

#. あっ、でも…そんな電子生徒手帳にも、
#. 唯一の<CLT 3>“弱点”<CLT>があるんですけどね…
msgctxt "0104 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Oh, but uh...even my amazing handbook does have one\n"
"single <CLT 3>weak point<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 弱点…？
msgctxt "0105 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It does?"
msgstr ""

#. 内緒だよ。それを教えちゃって壊されたら困るし。
msgctxt "0106 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"But it's a secret! I wouldn't want you to go breaking\n"
"any more handbooks!"
msgstr ""

#. では、桑田は知らず知らずの内に、
#. その弱点突いて、壊してしまったのか？
msgctxt "0107 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Then Leon must have broken it somehow without\n"
"realizing what its weakness was, right?"
msgstr ""

#. さぁ、どうでしょう？
msgctxt "0108 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Hmm...hard to say!"
msgstr ""

#. ボクはこう思うけどね。
#. 彼の電子生徒手帳は壊れてないって。
msgctxt "0109 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"You know what I think? I think his handbook isn't\n"
"actually broken!"
msgstr ""

#. さぁ、どうなんでしょう…！？
msgctxt "0110 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "But, you might ask, how could that be!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>意味深な言葉だけ残して、
#. モノクマはまた消えた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0111 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Leaving the question hanging in the air, Monokuma\n"
"disappeared.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …なんだったのだろうね、今の。
msgctxt "0112 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What just happened?"
msgstr ""

#. モノクマは壊れてないって言ってたけど…
#. でも、桑田クンの手帳が起動しないのも事実だし…
msgctxt "0113 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Monokuma said it's not broken. But it's an undeniable\n"
"fact that it's not turning on."
msgstr ""

#. 大した問題ではない。
#. 少なくとも、今回の事件とは無関係のはずだ。
msgctxt "0114 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Well, I don't see any connection to the case, so it\n"
"doesn't matter for now."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それでいいのかなぁ…
#. 何か引っかかるんだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0115 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>You think so? Either way, something about it still\n"
"bothers me...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>壊れた電子生徒手帳<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0116 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Broken e-Handbook<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. さてと…前置きはこれくらいで十分だろう。
msgctxt "0117 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Okay then, this should be enough to get things\n"
"rolling."
msgstr ""

#. そろそろ、本格的に捜査を進めて、
#. ヤツの正体を突き止めるとするか。
msgctxt "0118 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Let's begin our investigation in earnest and track\n"
"down the true culprit."
msgstr ""

#. 不二咲さんを殺した…犯人だね？
msgctxt "0119 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah. We need to find out who killed Chihiro!"
msgstr ""

#. …正確には違うな。
msgctxt "0120 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "To be exact...not quite."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>え？　正確には違う…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0121 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Huh? Not...quite?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>レターケースが置いてある。この中には…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0122 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a mailbox here. And inside...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>３つの電子生徒手帳がある。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0123 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...are three e-Handbooks.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>おそらく、江ノ島さんと桑田クンと舞園さんの物だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0124 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have to assume they're Junko's, Leon's, and\n"
"Sayaka's.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どうやら、死んだ生徒の電子生徒手帳は、
#. このレターケースに返還される仕組みらしい。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0125 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It looks like the handbooks of any dead students are\n"
"brought here to the mailbox somehow.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>校則にあるのは、
#. 『電子生徒手帳の他人への貸与禁止』
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0126 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The rule says, \"Loaning your e-Handbook to another\n"
"student is strictly prohibited.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT 4>禁止されてるのは他人に貸すって行為だけ。
#. つまり、<CLT><CLT 3>借りる事は禁止されていない<CLT><CLT 4>。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0127 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4><CLT 4>Only *lending* it against the rules. In other words,\n"
"<CLT><CLT 3>there's no problem with borrowing one<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それと、もう１つ気になるのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0128 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>One other thing that bothers me...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>桑田クンの電子生徒手帳が、
#. <CLT><CLT 3>起動しない<CLT><CLT 4>って事だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0129 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...is the fact that Leon's handbook <CLT><CLT 3>won't turn on<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマは壊れてないって言ってたけど…
#. でも、起動しないのは事実だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0130 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Monokuma said Leon's handbook isn't broken. But it\n"
"won't turn on, that much is certain.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今回の事件とは無関係なのかなぁ…
#. 何か引っ掛かるんだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0131 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is it really unrelated to the case? Either way,\n"
"something about it still bothers me...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…に銃みたいな物が付いている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0132 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera... And there's what I can only\n"
"assume is a gun attached to it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もの凄い…威圧感だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0133 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's so...chilling.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 待て…
#. まだここで調べるべき事があるだろう。
msgctxt "0134 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Hold on. There's still more here waiting to be\n"
"checked."
msgstr ""

#. 緊急事態なんだってば～！
#. 助けてッ！！
msgctxt "0135 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I said it's an emergency! Come help me!"
msgstr ""
